          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Two paths look especially useful: a small certified study of the signed cross terms to guide the main inequality, and a bounded analytic attempt to lower the outer threshold again. Mixed third- and fourth-derivative estimates suggest \\(2.7+\\varepsilon\\) as a plausible next target; that is an exponent calculation, not yet a theorem.\n"
